A Durham staff member has responded to your inquiry. 

Response: 
Good afternoon Kalin,Please reach out to Justin Weist with the Infrastructure Review team to see if you will need to build out the end of Clermont for a SFH.I would also recommend you talk to the State to ensure you are permitted to build a residence on a old landfill, as they may have certain permits or regulations. Please see my previous email for some NCDEQ contacts.Please reach out to Durham County Environmental Health about well determinations and standards for this lot: HealthInspector@dconc.govLet me know if you have any additional questions!Emma Howrilla&nbsp;(she/her/hers)
Planning Specialist
Planning &amp; Development Department
