Your initial inquiry is below.
Hi Emma,Thank you for the detailed response on 1621 Clermont Rd. Two follow-ups:

Access: for a single dwelling or a duplex on the upland portion fronting Clermont Rd, could a private driveway satisfy access requirements, or is a built public street required given the unmaintained right-of-way?
Water: does Durham require connection to public water where a main is not immediately available - i.e., would a private well be acceptable here (the Southwest corner&nbsp;of the property does not seem to be part of the landfill and perhaps a well would be possible) and does that interact with the minor-subdivision path under NCGS 160D-802(c) if I create one or two lots?

Appreciate your help.Best,
Kalin Ivanov


